{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_decision_tree", "label": "CRDT-Entscheidungsbaum", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ordnet die Datenform dem CRDT zu (einzelne Zahl, Einzelwert, Set, Map). Die Entscheidung gehoert frueh festgelegt: den CRDT-Typ spaeter zu wechseln erfordert eine Migration, weil das Wire-Format pro Typ verschieden und gespeicherte Daten nicht typuebergreifend kompatibel sind."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_composition_pattern", "label": "CRDT-Kompositions-Muster", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Das CRDT fuer jedes Leaf nach seiner Semantik waehlen und unter ORMap schachteln (der flexibelste Container). Trade-off: Komposition gibt atomare Operationen pro Tenant, mehrere Top-Level-Maps geben einfachere Typen, erlauben aber Cross-Map-Inkonsistenz."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_non_fits", "label": "Was CRDTs nicht koennen", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CRDTs sind pro Key atomar - Cross-Key-Transaktionen brauchen Saga, DB-Transaktionen oder ein eigenes Koordinationsprotokoll. Geordnete Listen (RGA, LSEQ) werden nicht ausgeliefert; ein PersistentActor-Journal IST die Ordnung. Kein CRDT bietet strikte Serialisierbarkeit. Serialisierung hat kein First-Class-Versioning, Schema-Aenderungen sind eine manuelle Rolling-Uebung. Auch nicht geeignet: hohe Key-Kardinalitaet, grosse Werte, haeufige Writes aus einer einzigen Quelle."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_counters_gcounter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_counters_pncounter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_lwwregister", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_registers_mvregister", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_sets_gset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_sets_orset", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_maps_lwwmap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_maps_ormap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_maps_gcountermap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_designing_data_crdt_composition_pattern", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_distributed_data_crdt_types_maps_ormap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/distributed-data/crdt-types/designing-data.mdx", "source_location": null, "w